        "description": "Search Morningstar for stocks, mutual funds and ETFs by name or ticker: name, ticker, type (stock, fund or etf), exchange and its market code, currency, and the id and link to use with /morningstar/v1/stock and /morningstar/v1/fund. 25 results a page; pass `next_page` back as `page`; null on the last page.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/morningstar-search",
